00:28:16,170 --> 00:28:16,550
[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

367
00:28:16,910 --> 00:28:17,271
[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

368
00:28:17,311 --> 00:28:18,251
[SPEAKER_01]: The badness is felt now.

369
00:28:18,852 --> 00:28:20,753
[SPEAKER_01]: So that's when people start practicing sensory strength.

370
00:28:20,773 --> 00:28:24,997
[SPEAKER_01]: It's always going to be mind will be there, in regard to things they're saying no to and so on.

371
00:28:25,577 --> 00:28:28,299
[SPEAKER_01]: But you realize, yeah, okay, that's how you start.

372
00:28:28,379 --> 00:28:29,700
[SPEAKER_01]: But it's actually, it's already here.

373
00:28:30,341 --> 00:28:33,003
[SPEAKER_01]: Although I'm not engaging with those things, I'm already feeling it here.

374
00:28:33,263 --> 00:28:34,144
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the gateway.

375
00:28:34,624 --> 00:28:36,545
[SPEAKER_01]: So, I should not be, oh, I must never see that, hear that.

376
00:28:36,946 --> 00:28:37,126
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

377
00:28:37,266 --> 00:28:39,167
[SPEAKER_01]: I should develop myself in regard to feeling.

378
00:28:39,207 --> 00:28:45,351
[SPEAKER_01]: I'm feeling right here, right now, in regard to the prospect of something to be seen, or heard, or smelled, or tasted, or touched.

379
00:28:45,411 --> 00:28:47,413
[SPEAKER_00]: Because you're already welcoming.

380
00:28:47,433 --> 00:28:48,653
[SPEAKER_00]: You're already resisting.

381
00:28:49,354 --> 00:28:49,974
[SPEAKER_01]: So, that's what I mean.

382
00:28:50,094 --> 00:29:01,462
[SPEAKER_01]: Instead of being concerned with the particulars, with the content of your experience, you start seeing, you start putting the present enduring feeling first, in regard to the content.

383
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:10,747
[SPEAKER_01]: So, in this case, the content is still, like, not quite defined, or there is something there, probably pleasant, waiting for you.

384
00:29:12,228 --> 00:29:18,933
[SPEAKER_01]: But the feeling here, that's agreeable on account of that, it's already defined, as far as the feelings can be defined in itself.

385
00:29:18,973 --> 00:29:19,674
[SPEAKER_01]: You recognize it.

386
00:29:20,194 --> 00:29:27,020
[SPEAKER_01]: There is agreeability, just by the simple knowledge that there might be something agreeable there for me, on a more specific level.

387
00:29:28,416 --> 00:29:30,598
[SPEAKER_01]: But that feeling of agreeability doesn't change.

388
00:29:30,678 --> 00:29:36,562
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the gateway through which you then accept the more specific agreeability of these sense objects and so on.

389
00:29:37,503 --> 00:29:39,985
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you don't need to wait to go there to deal with it.

390
00:29:40,485 --> 00:29:42,367
[SPEAKER_01]: You can deal with that feeling here and now.

391
00:29:42,387 --> 00:29:43,027
[SPEAKER_01]: Not delight in it.

392
00:29:43,087 --> 00:29:43,688
[SPEAKER_01]: Not welcome it.

393
00:29:44,048 --> 00:29:46,049
[SPEAKER_01]: Remain careful in regard to it.

394
00:29:46,069 --> 00:29:47,030
[SPEAKER_01]: Doesn't matter what's there.

395
00:29:47,210 --> 00:29:52,014
[SPEAKER_01]: If you end up even seeing it and so on, if it's nothing unwholesome, you won't be affected by it.

396
00:29:53,050 --> 00:29:54,571
[SPEAKER_01]: Because you haven't perverted that order.

397
00:29:54,671 --> 00:29:56,592
[SPEAKER_01]: You haven't put the object of your senses first.

398
00:29:57,012 --> 00:30:00,074
[SPEAKER_01]: You remain seeing it on the level of the feeling enduring.

399
00:30:06,038 --> 00:30:12,922
[SPEAKER_01]: And that's that whole sutra we did, like entering the forest, full of barbs and thorns.

400
00:30:13,282 --> 00:30:15,184
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you have to enter it.

401
00:30:15,204 --> 00:30:16,364
[SPEAKER_01]: It's just thorny everywhere.

402
00:30:18,786 --> 00:30:19,366
[SPEAKER_00]: How would you do it?

403
00:30:19,686 --> 00:30:20,367
[SPEAKER_00]: Very careful.

404
00:30:22,735 --> 00:30:23,995
[SPEAKER_00]: Move, go, slowly.

405
00:30:26,236 --> 00:30:29,677
[SPEAKER_01]: So, that's the important recognition, is to see that it's always here and now.

406
00:30:31,718 --> 00:30:33,799
[SPEAKER_01]: Things to be dealt with, are always here and now.

407
00:30:35,259 --> 00:30:50,144
[SPEAKER_01]: And if you have future fear, or fear about the future, or delight in the future, or worry about the past, the only reason you're engaged in those directions, is because here and now, it's either felt pleasantly, and you're welcoming it, indulging it, delighting in it, entertaining it, or it's felt unpleasantly, and you're trying to get rid of it.

408
00:30:52,150 --> 00:30:56,351
[SPEAKER_01]: Which means you're not seeing where the problem is.

409
00:30:56,371 --> 00:31:04,854
[SPEAKER_01]: You're still on the level of the content of your experience, not the context, as we covered in... we covered everything in all the talks.

410
00:31:07,654 --> 00:31:08,235
[SPEAKER_00]: Anyway, yeah...

